        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 60231, Ornate Narrow Backset Mortise Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's 60231 Lockset features an elaborate design that will fit in amongst even the most grandiose homes. Everything from the ornate swirling designs on the ends to the equally ornamented floral lever exudes sophistication. A narrow backset mortise handleset, it is designed to fit doors with backsets of either 1-1/2\" or 2\". It is available in either brass or shaded bronze in a wide array of functions including single cylinder, passage, and double cylinder entry.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available Matching <a href=\"/products/ornate-floral-leverset-omnia-231-00\"><b>Ornate Floral Leverset</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Narrow Backset Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ADA compliant.</li>\r\n<li>Made of solid brass with a heavy gauge plated steel case.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass 1/2\" lachbolt and 1\" deadbolt</li>\r\n<li>Schlage \"C\" keyway (for key functions).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ornate Mortise Lockset With Floral Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backplate Length: 11-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 1-1/2\" or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike: solid brass curved lip strike: 4-7/8\" x 1-1/4\" x lip 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1/2\" x 3/4\" x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\" x 1\" x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Case:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1-1/2\" backset: 6-1/16\" x 2-5/16\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>2\" backset: 6-1/16\" x 2-13/16\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN_narrow_bs_mortise_dimentions.pdf?v=1704262277\" target=\"new\"><b>Narrow Backset Mortise Lock Specification Diagram</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ornate Narrow Backset Handleset with Floral Lever",
                "description": "Omnia 60231 Ornate Narrow Backset Handleset With Floral Lever - Omnia's 60231 Lockset features an elaborate design that will fit in amongst even the most grandiose homes. Everything from the ornate swirling designs on the ends to the equally ornamented floral lever exudes sophistication. A narrow backset mortise handleset, it is designed to fit doors with backsets of either 1-1/2 inches or 2 inches. It is available in either brass or shaded bronze in a wide array of functions including single cylinder, passage, and double cylinder entry.",
                "keywords": "small backset locksets, omnia narrow backset mortise locks, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, OMN-60231, Omnia 60231, Ornate Narrow Backset Handlesets, Ornate Narrow Backset Mortise Locksets, narrow backset handlesets, ornate handlesets, fancy handlesets, ornate entrance sets, ornate mortise entrancesets, floral levers, ornate front door handles,"
